{"title":"Career Roadmap — Hardware Tester","role":"Hardware Tester","summary":"A Hardware Tester validates electronic products, components, circuit boards, embedded devices, and electronic systems to ensure they meet required functional, electrical, performance, reliability, and safety specifications.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Electronics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Hardware Tester validates electronic products, components, circuit boards, embedded devices, and electronic systems to ensure they meet required functional, electrical, performance, reliability, and safety specifications."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Electronics graduate, this is a practical career path combining:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Electronics","Circuit Testing","Instrumentation","Embedded Systems","Automation","Data Analysis"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work may involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PCB testing"},{"text":"Component testing"},{"text":"Functional testing"},{"text":"Electrical measurements"},{"text":"Hardware debugging"},{"text":"Environmental testing"},{"text":"Reliability testing"},{"text":"Production testing"},{"text":"Test automation"},{"text":"Hardware-software integration testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong long-term progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hardware Tester","Test Engineer","Hardware Validation Engineer","Senior Validation Engineer","Test Lead/Hardware Reliability Specialist"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Development Focus","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Electronics fundamentals, instruments, circuits, testing"},{"text":"Hardware Test Intern / Lab Trainee"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"PCB testing, debugging, test procedures"},{"text":"Hardware Tester / Test Technician"}],[{"tex